# ============================================================
# AI-LMC — contamination guard
#
# This repository is PUBLIC. The Q&A Bank, the artifact key, and
# every sealed decision log are the experiment's answer key and
# live in a separate private repository.
#
# These rules exist because a procedural mistake once placed the
# artifact key into a bundle handed to a participant agent (see
# PRE-REGISTRATION §9.2). Do not remove them. If a file below is
# ever added deliberately, that is a design change, not a
# convenience — amend the pre-registration first.
# ============================================================

# --- answer key: never commit ---
*ARTIFACT-KEY*
*QA-BANK*
*QA_BANK*
*EVALUATOR*
*HANDOVER*
*-sealed*
sealed/
**/sealed/

# --- decision logs produced during a run ---
assumptions-*.md
**/assumptions-*.md

# --- run working directories ---
runs/
participants/
participant/

# --- build output from any fixture opened locally ---
bin/
obj/
*.suo
*.user
*.vbproj.user
_UpgradeReport_Files/
.vs/

# --- os / editor noise ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.obsidian/
